CB1 output in vo_gpu_next.

Adds --cb1 to vo_gpu_next. It takes the mode dolby-vision or hdr10, the
same mode as --drm-dvbridge. CB1 draws each hardware decoded Dolby Vision
frame into the swapchain. A frame that carries an enhancement layer
picture in mp_image.dovi_el gives it to CB1 together with the base layer.
docs/cb1-integration.md of x86-linux-htpc describes the design.

License: the license of mpv (GPL-2.0-or-later for the new files).
